# HEADER
[0x0] Type
[0x1] Script Index
[0x2] Length
[0x3] Difficulty
[0x4] Bit mask {
    [0x01] Timeout card
    [0x02] Boss Invincible
    [0x04] Has Dialog Before
}
[0x5] Background Index / Dialogs count
[0x6] Max Score
[0x7] Good Drop
[0x8] Bad Drop
[0x9] SpellCard Index
[0xA] Create Script Index

# STRUCTURE
HEADER
NAME
DIALOGS